WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.107
Another evening on the bike. Same wall, same numbers, same thirty minutes.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:14.554
The bike is smart. It just never gives you a reason to come back tomorrow.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:24.637
Meet Telo Ride. It turns your smart bike at home into a game.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:35.525
One press pairs it over Bluetooth. Telo Ride reads your power, and sets the

00:00:35.525 --> 00:00:38.193
resistance for every hill and interval.

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:47.911
It runs in Chrome or Edge, on a phone, a tablet or a desktop.

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:50.452
Pair once, and it remembers your bike.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:01.377
Open Race, and step into a 3D course modelled after a real class.

00:01:01.722 --> 00:01:05.893
Chase your best-time ghost, a pack of bots, or live riders online.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:17.351
Every world has its own hills, turns and atmosphere: Ibiza Sunset Strip, Neon

00:01:17.351 --> 00:01:22.076
Docklands, Vice City, Cliffside Coast, Cinque Terre, and Haleakala.

00:01:22.421 --> 00:01:27.049
Built for smooth WebGPU riding, even on a tablet beside the bike.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:38.372
Or pick Classes. Ride along to a synced video, alone or on a live group board, while

00:01:38.372 --> 00:01:40.816
Telo Ride drives your resistance.

00:01:45.818 --> 00:01:51.380
Both doors feed one progression: XP, rider levels, daily streaks, stars, and map

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:52.236
unlocks.

00:01:58.722 --> 00:02:03.188
And for your own intervals, build, preview and ride a custom workout under

00:02:03.188 --> 00:02:04.755
Profile—even offline.

00:02:11.627 --> 00:02:16.719
Coming next: free local AI, running right inside your browser with Hugging Face

00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:18.952
models and Chrome built-in AI.

00:02:19.297 --> 00:02:24.314
Hands-free voice controls, a live kart-race announcer, cadence coaching, instant

00:02:24.314 --> 00:02:29.205
custom workouts, and optional saddle vision—zero cloud bills, and nothing ever

00:02:29.205 --> 00:02:30.697
leaves your device.

00:02:34.855 --> 00:02:37.179
Telo Ride. Your bike, now a game.

00:02:37.525 --> 00:02:42.128
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:02:42.473 --> 00:02:46.985
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:02:46.985 --> 00:02:48.656
every hill and interval.

00:02:49.001 --> 00:02:54.179
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:02:54.179 --> 00:02:59.627
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:59.627 --> 00:03:02.617
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:03:02.962 --> 00:03:05.455
A custom workout lives under Profile.
